# iCloud Drive conflict copies.
#
# ~/Documents is iCloud-managed, so a sync conflict silently drops a byte-identical
# duplicate beside every file it touches — "config 2.ts", "icon 3.png", ".gitignore 2".
# 285 of them appeared across the source tree in one session. They are untracked but
# not ignored, so `git add -A` would commit the lot.
#
# Neither pattern matches any tracked file (checked with `git ls-files`), and git
# ignores these rules for files already tracked, so nothing real can be hidden by them.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
